{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-05-18T12:08:11.279060+00:00", "modified": "2026-05-18T12:08:11.508602+00:00", "id": 18119350, "conceptrecid": "18119349", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.18119349", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "metadata": {"title": "One-Step Synthesis of Si-Graphene Heterostructures via In-Flight Gas-Phase Mixing for High-Capacity Silicon-Rich Anodes", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "publication_date": "2026-05-01", "description": "<p>The dataset includes raw and processed characterization and electrochemical data for gas-phase synthesized silicon/few-layer graphene (Si&ndash;FLG) heterostructures, including XRD, Raman spectroscopy, TGA/DSC, TEM, BET surface area analysis, electrical conductivity measurements, galvanostatic charge&ndash;discharge cycling, differential capacity (dQ/dV) analysis, and electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS).</p>\n<p>The data support the investigation of structure&ndash;property&ndash;performance relationships in gas-phase synthesized Si&ndash;FLG heterostructures for lithium-ion battery anodes.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Ali, Muhammad", "affiliation": "University of Waterloo", "orcid": "0009-0008-5319-8790"}, {"name": "Ali, Mukarram", "affiliation": "University of Waterloo", "orcid": "0000-0001-5627-8712"}, {"name": "Pope, Michael", "affiliation": "University of Waterloo", "orcid": "0000-0002-5793-3392"}, {"name": "Wiggers, Hartmut", "affiliation": "University of Duisburg-Essen", "orcid": "0000-0001-8487-9937"}, {"name": "Lorke, Axel", "affiliation": "University of Duisburg-Essen"}, {"name": "Jarrahizadeh, Yasaman", "affiliation": "University of Duisburg-Essen"}], "keywords": ["Silicon nanoparticles", "Few-layer graphene", "Gas-phase synthesis", "Lithium-ion batteries", "Silicon anodes", "Microwave plasma synthesis"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.1002/eem2.70333", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"title": "ENERGY & ENVIRONMENTAL MATERIALS"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "2803", "internal_id": "018mejw64::2803", "funder": {"name": "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft"}, "title": "IRTG"}, {"code": "565360", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000038::565360", "funder": {"name": "Natural Sciences and Engineering Research Council", "doi": "10.13039/501100000038", "acronym": "NSERC"}, "title": "CREATE"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "18119349"}}]}}, "title": "One-Step Synthesis of Si-Graphene Heterostructures via In-Flight Gas-Phase Mixing for High-Capacity Silicon-Rich Anodes", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18119350", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18119350?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.18119350", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119349", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18119349", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18119349", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.18119349", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:18119350/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:18119350/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/18119350/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/requests"}, "updated": "2026-05-18T12:08:11.508602+00:00", "recid": "18119350", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "14176632-e518-421c-9d6c-76214e20ee65", "key": "Si-FLG_Heterostructures_DATA.zip", "size": 73957212, "checksum": "md5:d868014a68ae0d33ebc26f0edd426756", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/18119350/files/Si-FLG_Heterostructures_DATA.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1502231"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 34, "unique_downloads": 30, "views": 74, "unique_views": 70, "version_downloads": 34, "version_unique_downloads": 30, "version_unique_views": 70, "version_views": 74}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2024-12-31T02:07:27.570029+00:00", "modified": "2024-12-31T02:07:28.239238+00:00", "id": 14576042, "conceptrecid": "13759418", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.13759418", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "metadata": {"title": "Dataset for 'Smart Health Evaluation for Lithium-ion Battery with Super-short-segment Charging'", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "publication_date": "2024-12-31", "description": "<p>This is the dataset used in our paper '<em>Smart Health Evaluation for Lithium-ion Battery with Super-short-segment Charging</em>', which mainly includes data from <strong>40Ah batteries</strong> at <strong>0.3C, 1C, 2C</strong>, and two <strong>280Ah batteries</strong> at <strong>20%, 60%, and 100% DOD</strong>, respectively. For specific details, please refer to Readme.text</p>\n<p>The data in<strong> LISHEN</strong> is the cycle test data of 40Ah battery at different discharge depths under 100%,60%,20%DOD working condition. The data in <strong>CATL</strong> and<strong> EVE </strong>is the cyclic test data of 280Ah battery at different discharge depths under 100%,60%,20%DOD conditions.&nbsp;<br>The CSV file has 21 or 17 columns, (17 columns for, data sequence number, good cycling, step number, step type, time (s) , total time (s) , current (a) , voltage (V) , capacity (AH) , charging capacity (AH) , discharge capacity (AH) , energy (Wh) , charging energy (Wh) , discharge energy (Wh) , absolute time (s) , power (W) , temperature (&deg; C-RRB-) , the 21-column CSV adds four metrics (DQ/DV (AH/V) in column 17, dQm/DV (mAh/V) in column 18, contact resistance (m &omega;) in column 19, and module start-stop status in column 20) , More detailed files can be found in the zip file.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Li, Qinghua", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0007-6776-5488"}], "keywords": ["Degradation", "battery"], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "13759418"}}]}}, "title": "Dataset for 'Smart Health Evaluation for Lithium-ion Battery with Super-short-segment Charging'", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14576042", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14576042?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.14576042", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/13759418", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/13759418", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.13759418", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.13759418", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14576042/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:14576042/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/14576042/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/requests"}, "updated": "2024-12-31T02:07:28.239238+00:00", "recid": "14576042", "revision": 4, "files": [{"id": "a2ddca0e-439e-494c-8fd1-fbab11756218", "key": "LISHEN-0.3C-100% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 1036229698, "checksum": "md5:242da88d82a2094d11e09c47bc9d95d9", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-0.3C-100%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "5233c8cb-f7f4-4fbf-93e4-85b4c6a99dc3", "key": "LISHEN-1C-60% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 649149966, "checksum": "md5:b2e8115d51f71daf8ebdeefdf44a7ee6", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-1C-60%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "afb48913-e171-49a8-a2e2-322dae97fe30", "key": "EVE.zip", "size": 3062552580, "checksum": "md5:82fdfb9c9d7a12690caebfee401aa720", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/EVE.zip/content"}}, {"id": "90679581-4fe2-4659-962e-e4308244c78b", "key": "LISHEN-2C-20% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 289796331, "checksum": "md5:d5abe16d00cc354d18a06e945e19f377", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-2C-20%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "41876477-0310-44e4-82e3-1a0c8202a4bb", "key": "Readme.txt", "size": 431, "checksum": "md5:b81c9273b2d2086970f2fe7bbcda7797", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/Readme.txt/content"}}, {"id": "84038cc6-11be-471d-a3ec-80397508566f", "key": "CATL.zip", "size": 2112139209, "checksum": "md5:2bb6ec01d8747978145cdf4729e907b9", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/CATL.zip/content"}}, {"id": "027924d1-a483-4dc8-aaec-ddc88583d4a2", "key": "LISHEN-0.3C-20% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 403487567, "checksum": "md5:d8ac0c50ef7d6706b63a9fd950d48510", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-0.3C-20%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "e2755ee1-7684-427d-8ad7-e980e819a03a", "key": "LISHEN-2C-100% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 833682937, "checksum": "md5:9931dd059eff0931064315468674a792", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-2C-100%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "7686424c-ae32-4d51-8c89-67f242de4ce9", "key": "LISHEN-0.3C-60% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 454058816, "checksum": "md5:f850969d929863d9b2ecef1c2515e2b9", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-0.3C-60%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "058bc2c8-9881-4347-86da-c489ec159891", "key": "LISHEN-2C-60% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 419385212, "checksum": "md5:57464e4455854c94e8a11322687e44a5", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-2C-60%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "e3c7ef82-2336-46bd-9309-762a79d670bc", "key": "LISHEN-1C-20% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 378920443, "checksum": "md5:49ca4869f75ae466cacd90e3eb22fda4", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-1C-20%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}, {"id": "28164ed1-24a1-4b01-b58c-3d29e0df4023", "key": "LISHEN-1C-100% Depth of Discharge.zip", "size": 898874398, "checksum": "md5:c1c1758eef429d38d29a522fc76fae9e", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/14576042/files/LISHEN-1C-100%25%20Depth%20of%20Discharge.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1187843"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 3834, "unique_downloads": 1789, "views": 1463, "unique_views": 1305, "version_downloads": 3620, "version_unique_downloads": 1655, "version_unique_views": 1131, "version_views": 1260}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2020-02-20T10:25:24.969111+00:00", "modified": "2024-07-22T12:25:44.996702+00:00", "id": 3676445, "conceptrecid": "3676444", "doi": "10.1088/1361-6528/ab6678", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6528/ab6678", "metadata": {"title": "Germanium tin alloy nanowires as anode materials for high performance Li-ion batteries", "doi": "10.1088/1361-6528/ab6678", "publication_date": "2020-01-28", "description": "<p><strong>Abstract</strong><br>\nThe combination of two active Li-ion materials (Ge and Sn) can result in improved conduction paths and higher capacity retention. Here we report for the first time, the implementation of Ge<sub>1&ndash;x</sub>Sn<sub>x</sub> alloy nanowires as anode materials for Li-ion batteries. Ge<sub>1&minus;x</sub>Sn<sub>x</sub> alloy nanowires have been successfully grown via vapor&ndash;liquid&ndash;solid technique directly on stainless steel current collectors. Ge<sub>1&minus;x</sub>Sn<sub>x</sub> (x = 0.048) nanowires were predominantly seeded from the Au<sub>0.80</sub>Ag<sub>0.20</sub> catalysts with negligible amount of growth was also directly catalyzed from stainless steel substrate. The electrochemical performance of the the Ge<sub>1&minus;x</sub>Sn<sub>x</sub> nanowires as an anode material for Li-ion batteries was investigated via galvanostatic cycling and detailed analysis of differential capacity plots (DCPs). The nanowire electrodes demonstrated an exceptional capacity retention of 93.4% from the 2nd to the 100th charge at a C/5 rate, while maintaining a specific capacity value of &sim;921 mAh g&minus;1 after 100 cycles. Voltage profiles and DCPs revealed that the Ge<sub>1&minus;x</sub>Sn<sub>x</sub> nanowires behave as an alloying mode anode material, as reduction/oxidation peaks for both Ge and Sn were observed, however it is clear that the reversible lithiation of Ge is responsible for the majority of the charge stored.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Doherty, Jessica", "affiliation": "University College Cork, Ireland"}, {"name": "McNulty, David", "affiliation": "University College Cork, Ireland"}, {"name": "Biswas, Subhajit", "affiliation": "University College Cork, Ireland"}, {"name": "Moore, Kalani", "affiliation": "University of Limerick, Ireland"}, {"name": "Conroy, Michele", "affiliation": "University of Limerick, Ireland"}, {"name": "Bangert, Ursel", "affiliation": "University of Limerick, Ireland"}, {"name": "O'Dwyer, Colm", "affiliation": "University College Cork, Ireland"}, {"name": "Holmes, Justin D.", "affiliation": "University College Cork, Ireland"}], "